Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:00:50.03,0:00:50.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:02:21.00,0:02:21.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:12:33.02,0:12:33.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:23.03,0:22:23.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:53.04,0:23:53.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lilly-san, let's do it together!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.13,0:00:24.09,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our very scrumptious-looking crab hotpot...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}is finished!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ooh, it looks so good!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.31,0:00:36.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I'm digging in!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.89,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We're LuluttoLilly and we love it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The crab is so yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.11,0:00:50.03,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Nothing fits a hotpot like Umapon!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.56,0:00:36.43,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Wow, that was interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.89,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,These are the idols Rui likes.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.89,0:00:42.40,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,They're very popular right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly, was it?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,They look just like our girls.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.57,0:00:48.78,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,I can see it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.01,0:02:36.14,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.43,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.43,0:02:40.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm heading home soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.60,0:02:45.60,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Here's the time table for you to check.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.61,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.36,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.36,0:02:53.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Time sure flies, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.24,0:02:57.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We've done all our prep,\Nso now we just gotta give the festival our all.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.33,0:03:03.66,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.71,0:03:08.17,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,For bringing me into this.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.88,0:03:12.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,\Nnone of this would've happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.55,0:03:18.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you!\NI couldn't have done this alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.43,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I've only made it this far because of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.10,0:03:25.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey, you're blushing!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's all enjoy this together.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.36,0:03:31.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright, move along!\NWe've got an early start tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can't have you oversleeping!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I won't...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's see... It should be this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Gotta transform.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.47,0:03:56.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.53,0:04:24.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A poster for the festival!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.09,0:04:37.72,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,There we go. I oughta close up for the day.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.88,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Is there anything fun to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.39,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.93,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Everyone, come to the plaza!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.93,0:04:44.89,Default,Creatures,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.89,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,There's a special event today!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.06,0:04:54.15,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,There's idols with magic powers\Nperforming in a human music festival!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.57,0:04:57.65,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Everyone's favorite idols, LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.65,0:05:01.41,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Hey, I know them! I saw that program with the crab!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.99,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,It's Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.37,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan is magical too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.37,0:05:09.16,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Now, find yourself a seat before it's taken!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Just waiting for Lilly.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.21,0:05:16.25,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The earlier the better!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.42,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Glad {\i1}you've{\i0} got energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Guys, I'm here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}There{\i0} she is. Morning, Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.30,0:05:24.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.80,0:05:26.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.18,0:05:27.68,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,G'mornin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.43,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Azuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.19,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,She's asleep...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.19,0:05:35.23,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Well, we're all here. Let's move.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.19,Default,All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.07,0:05:41.32,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Shoot! I forgot my ticket!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sena-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I never gave it to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.24,0:05:46.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.74,0:05:49.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Asahi, sleep while you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.77,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you for this gift!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.70,0:06:27.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's so wide!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.58,0:06:31.25,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko, how are we getting to the venue?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I rented a car.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.33,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.75,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,let's have some fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Do we have enough time before the concert?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.59,0:06:45.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah. The prep's all done,\Nso consider this the final touch.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.59,0:06:48.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay! Let's play!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.43,0:06:54.60,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I'll be around. If you need me, give me a call.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.32,Default,All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I think it'd look good on you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}I think you'd rock it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.05,0:07:23.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}You think so?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.88,0:07:25.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Are we here too early? Not a lot of stores are open.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.05,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,That place is open!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.93,Default,Waitress,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.39,0:07:39.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And it looks so yummy...\NThank you for the food!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.32,0:07:46.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's almost time... I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.36,0:07:51.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! We should do something fun on stage.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.74,0:07:52.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.95,0:07:54.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Like show off our talents or something!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We're literally idols...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.62,0:08:01.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw. But I think everyone would enjoy it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.88,0:08:07.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's fine. They'll have our new song to enjoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.63,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's show them what we can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.43,0:08:14.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't wait to sing with all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.53,0:08:28.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Our rehearsal order is...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.08,0:08:34.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Asahi-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.00,0:08:42.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I told you to get some sleep on the train.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.59,0:08:47.97,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you! I've never been more happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.97,0:08:50.13,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.51,0:08:50.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8}Does she think the concert's over?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good speech.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But save it for the show.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're adorable, Asahi-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We gotta make this concert count!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.86,0:09:07.78,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.99,0:09:16.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.16,0:09:19.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is fun, right, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.37,0:09:23.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're gonna nail it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.13,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yep, yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.56,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Look, a face cut-out photo op!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.94,0:09:42.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's take a pic!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.02,0:09:46.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.98,0:09:48.98,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'll take the picture!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.98,0:09:49.86,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.57,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Let me take it for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.53,0:09:54.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.45,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Appreciated!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:09:58.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.41,0:10:03.29,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't these girls...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.00,0:10:12.47,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,You're LuluttoLilly, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.05,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,I'm such a huge fan!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.05,0:10:18.68,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd meet you here!\NJeez, what luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.85,Default,LS Member 2,0,0,0,,Relax, leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.56,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Get off my case.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.89,0:10:26.23,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're all performing in the festival, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.23,0:10:28.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I'm a fan too, so I'm planning to see your concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.52,0:10:32.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, you're that band that's gotten crazy popular,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Long Serenade!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.41,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.74,0:10:39.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Someone as big as you knows about those two?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.25,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Does she mean us?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.62,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,I saw LuluttoLilly's concert too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.54,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,It was an amazing performance.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.54,0:10:51.71,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,But then the next time I saw them,\Nthey were fighting a crab.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.71,0:10:53.67,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,What on earth are you two doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.05,0:10:56.93,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Now I'm excited to see what you do next.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.93,0:11:00.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That wasn't really our plan, though...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe we {\i1}do{\i0} need a gag for our concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's drop that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.10,0:11:08.69,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,You want to make everyone smile, right, Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.69,0:11:15.70,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,And Lulu, you love singing just like I do, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I do love singing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But for today's festival...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.21,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,hearing all of our voices together
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,is what I'm really excited for!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So am I!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.67,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yep, yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.17,0:11:35.30,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,I gotta roll. Good luck today!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.05,0:11:38.72,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.97,0:11:43.47,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Aw, being an idol looks fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.47,0:11:45.18,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,Maybe I should try it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.69,Default,LS Member 2/3,0,0,0,,– Really?\N– No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.11,0:11:54.69,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Whew, it's almost time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.69,0:11:58.20,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,More: Once More is finally gonna debut!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.61,0:12:02.20,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,We're about to witness a brand new legend!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.20,0:12:04.08,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,So dramatic.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.08,0:12:06.75,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,You're excited for this too, dude.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.75,0:12:08.62,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,A little bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.34,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.59,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,be honest with me already.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.22,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,You want one?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.84,0:12:18.88,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Aren't those...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.88,0:12:23.14,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,two of 200 limited edition penlights\Nfrom LuluttoLilly's first concert?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.14,0:12:26.52,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Sure is. And if you're honest with me, I'll give you one.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.36,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I'm super excited!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.99,0:12:41.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What a nice breeze!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.32,0:12:44.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It is. The air is very fresh too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.20,0:12:47.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That was a real surprise back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.00,0:12:51.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,There's gonna be other popular people\Nat the festival venue, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.92,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah. Tons of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.92,0:12:56.80,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Whoa... that's awesome.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.43,0:13:02.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena, did I lock up the agency?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.14,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.14,0:13:06.10,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot my makeup tools!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You can borrow mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.06,0:13:11.40,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Really?! Can I take them home?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.77,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I've got mine too.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.32,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.90,0:13:17.03,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.03,0:13:20.32,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to cherish my oshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.12,0:13:25.66,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I thought you were a Once More veteran.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.70,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I have your merch too, Sena-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You sure know a lot, Asahi-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.87,0:13:31.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You do!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.01,0:13:41.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh no... I'm getting nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.63,0:13:43.93,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm gonna puke...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.68,0:13:46.72,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.89,0:13:53.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,if I can perform with all of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.73,0:13:56.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I thought I was ready, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.53,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,T-Toko-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.70,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Do you feel sick?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.86,0:14:04.70,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.91,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm just... so nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You want to stand on stage with all of us, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.54,0:14:17.29,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's make this a magical performance!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.89,0:14:26.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yes, Prez?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.68,0:14:35.73,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where are you? It's almost rehearsal time.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.36,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should get to the venue ASAP.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.19,0:14:43.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go, girls!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.03,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.09,0:15:03.09,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,They had some for cats, so it should be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.63,0:15:07.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,These costumes are adorable!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.34,0:15:10.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm getting pumped up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.98,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.48,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's almost time!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.99,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Shinshu Music Fes—
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.99,0:15:25.49,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,SMF!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.82,0:15:30.24,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Everyone in the crowd, are you ready?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.12,Default,Creature 3,0,0,0,,You go, Bernard!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.75,Default,Creature 3,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.33,0:15:36.58,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.13,Default,Meeter,0,0,0,,They've really made it big.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.88,0:15:42.63,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,Once we hear their songs...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.63,0:15:48.14,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,we'll know for certain whether they're fit\Nto be the festival's songstress.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.80,0:15:52.89,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,But for now, let's enjoy their beautiful singing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.89,0:15:56.14,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,Now, finally coming on stage...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.52,0:16:02.86,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,it's the debut of Production Once More's\Nfresh new idol group!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.40,0:16:08.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I don't think I'd have made it here\Nwithout all of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.86,0:16:12.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Who knows what awaits us\Nafter this concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.54,0:16:14.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,True that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.91,0:16:19.17,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I want to watch the world change\Nin front of me, with all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.17,0:16:20.58,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.58,0:16:21.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's do that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.51,0:16:28.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You too, Asahi-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Once...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.18,Default,All,0,0,0,,More-More!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.27,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,More: Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.02,0:16:45.73,Default,Kento,0,0,0,,And now, here they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.12,0:16:57.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you! We're More: Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.71,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Asahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.92,0:17:04.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.05,0:17:16.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Here's a song from all five of us! Please enjoy!
Dialogue: 51,0:17:19.77,0:17:23.27,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}We swear we will shine{私たち世界で一番}
Dialogue: 51,0:17:23.27,0:17:26.40,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brighter than anything in the world{輝くことを誓うよ}
Dialogue: 51,0:17:26.40,0:17:30.40,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Guess what, our never-ending illusion{ねぇ終わらないイリュージョン}
Dialogue: 51,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.41,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Starts here and now, are you ready?{Ready?ここから始めよう}
