Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.91,0:17:37.04,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.33,0:17:43.79,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,The magic device is out of control!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.79,0:17:46.04,Default,Mucchi,0,0,0,,This is bigger than I imagined.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Here we g—
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.76,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.02,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.27,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu, run!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.27,0:18:06.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Asahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Magic...?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So pretty...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.28,0:18:15.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Not the point! I have to do something.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.16,0:18:18.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.54,0:18:25.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're singing here. Don't interrupt us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.42,0:18:28.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.88,0:18:31.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.72,0:18:34.93,Default,Spectator 1,0,0,0,,It's gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.64,Default,Spectator 2,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.06,0:18:39.51,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.14,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Take our song...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.65,0:18:50.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,and away to the magic world with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.41,Default,LS Member 3,0,0,0,,That's a crazy act.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.46,Default,LS Vocalist,0,0,0,,I've got goosebumps.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.67,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.80,0:19:19.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being with LuluttoLilly really does\Nmake things more exciting!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena! Asahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.44,0:19:30.90,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Everyone! Let's take it from the top!
Dialogue: 51,0:19:32.36,0:19:35.70,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}We swear we will shine{私たち世界で一番}
Dialogue: 51,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.95,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Brighter than anything in the world{輝くことを誓うよ}
Dialogue: 51,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.79,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Guess what, our never-ending illusion{ねぇ終わらないイリュージョン}
Dialogue: 51,0:19:42.79,0:19:45.91,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Starts here and now, are you ready?{Ready?ここから始めよう}
Dialogue: 51,0:19:50.00,0:19:52.05,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}One, two, three, four, five{一、二、三、四、五}
Dialogue: 51,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.72,INS,Toko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\an8}(Here we go)
Dialogue: 51,0:20:00.22,0:20:03.14,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Saying what I'm feeling makes me feel shy{言葉にすると照れくさい}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:03.14,0:20:05.85,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Everyone has dreams of their own, right?{夢って誰にもあるよね}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:05.85,0:20:09.81,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}But you're running with me{でも一緒に走るWith me}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.40,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}So I can tell you{キミに話すよ}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:11.40,0:20:13.94,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\an8}(Secret)
Dialogue: 51,0:20:12.40,0:20:15.24,INS,Toko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}If we bring our wishes together{願いを重ねるとね}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:14.23,0:20:16.95,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\an8}(Harmony)
Dialogue: 51,0:20:15.24,0:20:17.95,INS,Sena,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}It'll make even more miracles{キセキが増えてゆくから}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:17.95,0:20:20.99,INS,Asahi,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}So don't be afraid of change{変わることは恐れないで}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:20.99,0:20:23.87,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Be honest towards your dream{夢に素直に}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:23.87,0:20:29.75,INS,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Even when your kindness is misunderstood and hurts instead{優しさすれ違い傷つく時も}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:29.75,0:20:35.46,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}It's an opportunity to improve yourself{心（心）磨く（磨く）チャンスになる}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.42,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\an8}(More: Once More!){もあ・わんすもあ！}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:36.63,0:20:42.43,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}We'll keep chasing our dreams{ダイヤモンドみたい煌めく}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:42.43,0:20:48.39,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining and unbreakable like diamonds{砕けない夢を追いかけてく}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.27,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can't stop these feelings{止まらない気持ち}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:51.27,0:20:54.32,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I want you to get them too{ビビビッ キミに届けたい}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:54.32,0:20:59.36,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sparking in brilliant colors{ときめくカラースパークする}
Dialogue: 51,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.57,INS,More:OnceMore,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}This Diamond Dream{Diamond Dream}
